    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2dd928a8d4074efb8dd6fa4e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“No pain No gain”?",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e90dfdb8485ee977753eb5d36999aeda54f58325002e8a362a5ac2c8ad81e7b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1050/storytimeline_041050002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:461b7f80b773f8b17e755a35",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然身材娇小，却拥有强大的末脚——\n更关键的是，拥有对胜利的渴望的赛马娘，成田大进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c8451407ba83cbb84927d681a562c1dd88e94188082f991e37931e5e44e79d3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1050/storytimeline_041050003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7e758b1e8fd5dd6a8dd6876",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我调查了一下她的过去，\n发现了她在入学前参加比赛的录像带……",
      "source_fingerprint": "cad99867bc7e29f450d72be812f0ff77af95f2fc0103b16ae699478e95028f52",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1050/storytimeline_041050003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8c33b7ed2e5e1f671d860b2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（这就是她的武器……！）",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8fc4c3604dce279a623a35730ef9e5c858ca9401f69fec5bda5af1e96464096",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
