    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a10aff4fa983728d1e7e195",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是，后半程，特别是最后三弗隆，\n比起同距离的其他比赛而言，她的速度称得上出类拔萃！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a57e1ff45f66c9e48c35b98d7409b8732e328dfc35be202b86160fdfcdf3194",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1050/storytimeline_041050003.json",
      "json_path": [
