    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ab98faa4ea292bb12062b44",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在先前的选拔赛中，她急于争夺序盘位置，消耗了过多体力，\n以至于终盘的冲刺没法发挥出全部实力。但是——",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0d9fc53c1ad78cbf40d86ff2b36e473e783d569d14d02543e99d2923c8083bb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1050/storytimeline_041050003.json",
      "json_path": [
