    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cd9c11180a55b74b683cee7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "只要一想到这件事情我就坐立难安。\n等我回过神来的时候，我已经跑到了成田大进身边。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2e95c5dad5e5e60f19438920d9cb5c7a77bf10953d912b15cd0e8f3a99832f5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
