      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "啊！！昨天和大进待在一起的训练员！！\n这，莫非是——",
      "source_fingerprint": "a007b73ae9fa0019460ae30ac5feb2d36438485d7d7d5b7afbe323bb4b8763e8",
